{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07762","headline":"人日登南阳驿门亭子怀汉川诸友 · 孟浩然","name":"人日登南阳驿门亭子怀汉川诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝来登陟处，不似艳阳时。\n异县殊风物，羁怀多所思。\n剪花惊岁早，看柳讶春迟。\n未有南飞雁，裁书欲寄谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}